     I am using the following files from the bluez-firmware-1.0 package:

           MD5 (BCM2033-MD.hex) = 5580317158d07fc4ace90af04f8e1c73
           MD5 (BCM2033-FW.bin) = b4e142b3272cfe5a84b32fda6b4b032f

